What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/38900000.lcd/panel_power
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	6.14
Contact:	Kailash <kailash.sudhakar@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RW) Panel power state of the iPod touch 2G (N72) display
		controller (apple,n72-lcd). Reading returns "1" while the
		panel is not blanked and "0" while it is. Writing a boolean
		value (as accepted by kstrtobool, for example "0" or "1")
		blanks or unblanks the panel; writing the current state has no
		effect. Invalid input returns -EINVAL.
